  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Time period <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></math> Angular frequency of SHM</p><p>Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Angular frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></math></p><p>Option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Angular frequency of SHM</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></math>.</p><p>So option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> both have angular frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#969;</mi></math> but option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> is direct answer.</p>",
